      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLIPPERY GYPSY (2) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 13 lengths fourth (18.18) last time in a Grade 6/MDN at this track over 305m. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Rates a top chance. READY TO BURN (1) is a newcomer for the Kyle Goodwin kennel. Drawn well and should get her chance. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. MOONLIGHT HAZE (4) is still a maiden after 11 runs but rarely out of the placings, the latest filling a minor again when third at Warrnambool. Returns to a favourable course. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Will give a great sight again. MY MAN STAN (7) is by Aussie Infrared out of Princess Kiwi making debut. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Respect any moves in the market.",
